description:
## Goal

Prove the warning cutover complete, remove every alternate authority and temporary affordance, and leave exact causal signals and documentation for the long-lived recalculator.

## Acceptance signal

Across focused programs and the complete fixture/CLI matrix:

- warning evidence lives only in the existing World fact/value authority and is supported only by ordinary demanded producer attempts;
- the current diagnostic snapshot lives only in the existing ProductMemo authority and follows exact retained request/product/fact/provenance dependencies;
- every rendered warning has current typed evidence and exact source-version provenance;
- removing the last semantic/source/request support retracts the evidence and snapshot entry; independent support survives;
- identical requests preserve evidence and snapshot allocation/generation and perform zero producer/product evaluations, wakes, allocations, deep copies, or changed revisions;
- unrelated replacement causes zero warning, semantic, product, backend, or native movement for the requested root;
- relevant semantic replacement moves only the exact transitive dependents;
- location-only replacement changes diagnostic provenance/snapshot while preserving semantic/backend/native identity and generation;
- cold functions, unobserved contract alternatives, and unreachable local matches remain absent from work, fact, dependency, and product inventories;
- FIFO, LIFO, hash-seed, and stress permutation produce semantically and byte-identical snapshots.

Use the existing causal attempt/fact/product telemetry to assert presence and absence. Add or retain only durable events with a production consumer; delete ticket-only counters and probes before close. Wall time may corroborate but never substitute for deterministic counts.

## Removal census

Require zero production references to source-time/whole-contract clause coverage, `is_inexhaustive`, warning-once registries, warning queues/flushes, warning-specific support maps, duplicate pattern plans, root/function/source/World scans, diagnostic retry maps, display-string identity/order, `Span::DUMMY` warning provenance, private diagnostic cones, second snapshot caches, and transition adapters.

Remove obsolete goldens/tests rather than reblessing them blindly. Remove all compatibility code, fixtures, probes, and counters introduced by the child tickets unless they are durable production-boundary regressions or telemetry.

Update northstar, agent docs, guides, fixture documentation, and ticket cross-references to state the final ownership model. Full deterministic, library, fixture-matrix, CLI, AOT, docs, formatting, check, and strict workspace/all-target Clippy gates pass. Fresh ticket-scoped cold adversarial review precedes one commit and close.
